    "referenceSolution": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <set>\n#include <map>\n#include <queue>\n#include <deque>\n#include <stack>\n#include <numeric>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <climits>\n#include <utility>\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){string s,t;getline(cin,s);getline(cin,t);int i=0;for(char c:t)if(i<(int)s.size()&&s[i]==c)i++;cout<<(i==(int)s.size()?\"YES\":\"NO\")<<'\\n';}\n",
